        "text": "I have created the `presigned_download.py` script in the current working directory. This script uses the Boto3 library to generate a time-limited signed download URL for a stored object in Amazon S3. You can modify the `bucket_name` and `object_name` variables in the example usage to test the script with your own S3 resources.",
